  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`7 3 - 9 4 + * 5 2 * - 6 /`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一个单独的数值,请计算下方后缀表达式:\n\n`7 3 - 9 4 + * 5 2 * - 6 /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "1",
            "zh": "1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\n`7 3 - 9 4 + * 5 2 * - 6 / = (7 - 3) (9 + 4) * (5 * 2) - 6 /`\n\n`= 4 13 * 10 - 6 / = (4 * 13) 10 - 6 /`\n\n`= 52 10 - 6 / = (52 - 10) 6 /`\n\n= 42 6 / = (42 / 6) = 7",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n从左到右读后缀式。先算 $7-3=4$ 和 $9+4=13$，相乘得 52。另一段 $5\\times2=10$，从 52 中减去 10 得 42，最后 $42/6=7$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
