    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to prefix:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6+9*(7-5)}{(4-2)^{3}}\n$$",
        "zh": "请将下方中缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6+9*(7-5)}{(4-2)^{3}}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 6 * 9 - 7 5 ^ - 4 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + 6 * 9 - 7 5 ^ - 4 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / 6 9 * - 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`",
            "zh": "`+ / 6 9 * - 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 6 * 9 - 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`",
            "zh": "`/ + 6 * 9 - 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + * - ^ - 6 9 7 5 4 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + * - ^ - 6 9 7 5 4 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 6 9 - + 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`",
            "zh": "`/ + 6 9 - + 7 5 ^ - 4 2 3`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n$$\n\\frac{6+9*(7-5)}{(4-2)^{3}}=(6+9*(7-5))/((4-2)^3)\n$$\n\n= (6 + 9 * (− 7 5)) / ((− 4 2) ^ 3) = (6 + (* 9 − 7 5)) / (^ − 4 2 3) = (+ 6 * 9 − 7 5) / (^ − 4 2 3) = / + 6 * 9 − 7 5 ^ − 4 2 3",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n分子从内层的 $7-5$ 开始，先变成 `- 7 5`，再形成 `+ 6 * 9 - 7 5`。分母先减后立方，写成 `^ - 4 2 3`。除号放在两个完整操作数前面。"
      },
      "source": {
